      "purpose": "Rendezvous is bootstrap-only."
    }
  ],
  "prose": {
    "summary": "Define msg messaging as peer-to-peer identity-addressed communication over WebRTC, with rendezvous used only for peer bootstrap and no central application-payload authority.",
